  "project_description": "When searching for content in a multilingual website, Drupal core node search displays results in all languages.\n\n This module will remove the option to filter results by language and always show the current language results in the core node search. \n\n \n Back to top \n\n Related core issues \n \n [#3045362] \n [#3041039] \n \n \n Back to top \n\n Installation \n \n Normal module installation procedure. \n \n \n Back to top \n\n Configuration \n No configuration needed, just install and enable the module.\n\n \n Back to top \n\n Credits \n Powered by Javali \n\n Back to top",
